# File:    cloud-providers.env
# Purpose: Secret-scanner fixture. Cloud provider credential shapes.
#          Every value below is synthetic and non-functional - it exists only so
#          the detector's regexes have something to match. DO NOT replace with
#          real credentials.
# Author:  Vigilnz Security Engineering
# Date:    2026-10-16
#
# Expected rules: aws-access-key, aws-secret-key, aws-session-token,
#   aws-account-id, gcp-api-key, firebase-api-key, azure-client-secret,
#   azure-storage-key, azure-connection-string, azure-devops-pat,
#   digitalocean-token, heroku-api-key, vercel-token, netlify-token,
#   cloudflare-api-token, env-file-credential

